TENDER FOR ANNUAL GROUNDS MAINTENANCE SERVICES

Prepared for:  Dame Hannah Rogers Trust
               Woodland Road, Ivybridge

Contract Period:  1st March 2026 – 28th February 2027
                  (52 weeks)

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

1. INTRODUCTION

Green Green Grass is pleased to submit this tender for the
provision of ongoing grounds maintenance services at Dame Hannah
Rogers Trust, Woodland Road, Ivybridge. This document sets out
the proposed scope of works and associated hours for the
attention of the Estates / Facilities team.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

2. SCOPE OF WORKS

The following maintenance activities will be carried out
throughout the contract period:

  2.1  Hedge Cutting
       Cutting and trimming of all boundary hedges and internal
       hedges/shrubs as required to maintain a neat and tidy
       appearance, including the removal of all arisings.

  2.2  Grass Cutting
       Regular cutting of all lawned areas within the grounds
       and external verges to a maintained height appropriate
       to the season, including edging of borders and paths.

  2.3  Arthur's Area Maintenance
       Dedicated maintenance of Arthur's area, including
       general upkeep and presentation of the space.

  2.4  Weed Treatment
       Application of approved weed killer to all hard
       surfaces, including patios, paths and driveways within
       the grounds, as required throughout the season.

  2.5  Leaf Clearance
       Leaf blowing and collection across all areas of the
       grounds as required, particularly during the autumn
       period, to keep the site clean and safe.

  2.6  General Grounds Maintenance
       Any surplus time within the contracted hours will be
       utilised to carry out general maintenance works as
       directed by the client, ensuring the grounds remain in
       good order throughout the year.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

3. STAFFING & HOURS

  Operatives:      1 x Qualified Groundsman
  Hours per week:  16 hours
  Contract weeks:  52 weeks per year
  Total hours:     832 hours per annum

All work will be carried out by Jonathan Axten of Green Green
Grass, a qualified and experienced grounds maintenance
professional.

────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

4. INCLUSIONS & EXCLUSIONS

  Included:
    - Public liability insurance (copy available on request)
